## Documents and experimental data — CC BY 4.0

All Markdown documents (`README*.md`, `docs/`, `design/`), figures (`*.png`), CSV/JSON/JSONL
results (`results/`, `background/`) and `SHA256SUMS.txt` are released under
**Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International** (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

You may share and adapt this material for any purpose, including commercially, provided you give
appropriate credit, link the licence and indicate changes.

**Attribution requirement specific to this archive**: when citing the negative results, the `Θ̂`
calibration or the boundary estimates, state that these are **explore / terminated-stage archived
results** with `final_decision = null`, and not formal verdicts on the pre-registered hypotheses.
See `docs/en/05-reproduction-and-archive.md` for suggested wording.

## Third-party material not included

The MOT17, MOT20 and DanceTrack datasets, OSNet weights and TrackEval library are **not**
redistributed here and remain subject to their own licences and terms of use. This repository
contains only our own code, derived measurements and documentation.
